n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable - macOS 12.6.0 - GLES3 (Compatibility) - Apple M1 - Apple M1 (8 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nNested submenus (3+ levels deep) are positioned to the left of their parent instead of continuing to cascade to the right, even when there's plenty of screen space available. Debug output shows that for embedded PopupMenus, the viewport size and window size are incorrectly reported as the submenu's own dimensions, not the actual window/screen dimensions.\n\n---- Submenu Debug ----\nParent menu: @PopupMenu@52\nParent position: (920, 788)\nParent size: (152, 157)\nSubmenu position: (624, 789)\nSubmenu size: (296, 188)\nViewport size: (296, 188)\nViewport visible rect: (296, 188)\nWindow size: (296, 188)\nScreen count: 1\nCurrent screen: 0\nScreen size: (2880, 1800)\nIf positioned to right, edge would be at: 1368\nIs this > viewport width? true\nIs this > window width? true\nIs this > screen width? false\nIs embedded? true\n\n<img width=\"578\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/75db47d7-0be1-4299-a0d6-24bff56a2110\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nAny 3 level chain of submenus, see MRP.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[buggy.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19524552/buggy.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos